muew-preset 2
name Acid Squelch
category Lead
author MUEW Factory
tags acid resonant squelch aggressive bright
desc Resonant low pass with a sharp envelope. Play short notes and ride RESO.
osc1Shape 2
osc2Shape 3
osc2Detune 0
osc2Level 0.2
filterCutoff 500
filterReso 6
filterMode 0
amp 0.002 0.2 0.6 0.08
mod 0.001 0.25 0 0.1
lfo1Rate 5
lfo1Shape 0
lfo2 0.35 1
warp1 2 0
warp2 6 0
mseg 1 0 4 0 0 0.15 1 0.55 -0.3 1 0
routes 8
route 1 2 3.5
route 2 2 0.8
route 5 2 3
route 6 5 0.7
route 6 6 0.7
route 7 4 4
route 8 1 0.3
route 8 3 0.25
chorus 0 0.6 6 15 0.35
delay 1 0.24 0.36 0.3 0.15
reverb 0 0.55 0.45 0.28
